# Opt-in file for scripts/pii_guard.py (pre-push hook and the pii-guard GitHub Action).
# Below: exact strings that are allowed although they look like personal data, one per line.
# `skip: <path or glob>` excludes a path; `check: internal` also blocks .internal addresses (remove the "# " below to turn it on).
# check: internal
# Only the owner adds entries. Agents never add one to get past a block (AGENTS.md "Personal data").
